---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="case-study-container">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Portfolio</a>
		
		<header class="case-header">
			<span class="badge">Native Android App</span>
			<h1>Semesta</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">An advanced native Android application showcasing modern UI patterns, modular architecture, and robust state management.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>Overview & Purpose</h2>
			<p>Semesta was engineered to explore and implement modern native Android UI paradigms and scalable application design. The primary focus was delivering fluid animations, responsive layouts, and a decoupled codebase that scales seamlessly.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>Architecture & Technical Design</h2>
			<div class="grid-2">
				<div class="card">
					<h3>UI Toolkit</h3>
					<p>Built fully with <strong>Jetpack Compose</strong>, utilizing custom layout modifiers, dynamic state hoisting, and Material Design components.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="card">
					<h3>Code Quality & Structure</h3>
					<p>Features a modularized codebase separating feature logic from core utilities, ensuring high maintainability and clean separation of concerns.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>Core Engineering Highlights</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Declarative UI Patterns:</strong> Utilized state flows and Compose side-effects to handle complex, real-time user interactions smoothly.</li>
				<li><strong>Robust State Management:</strong> Leveraged Kotlin Coroutines and StateFlow to maintain predictable UI states across lifecycle changes.</li>
				<li><strong>Optimized Performance:</strong> Minimized unnecessary recompositions to ensure smooth rendering performance on lower-end devices.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	body {
		background-color: #090d16;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
	}
	.case-study-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
	}
	.back-link {
		color: #38bdf8;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.case-header h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
	}
	.subtitle {
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}
	.badge {
		background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
		color: #38bdf8;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
		border-radius: 50px;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
	}
	.content-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}
	.content-section h2 {
		color: #38bdf8;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.grid-2 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
	.card {
		background: #111827;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;
	}
	ul {
		color: #94a3b8;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	ul strong {
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}
</style>